   "copper": 19,
   "description": "Vaska Ashlistener needs fighters at Ashveil Watch on Blackwind Rise, where the Throng is fighting to hold its ground. Go and report to Vaska. I have watched you protect the people who put spears in our hands; now carry that strength to the line.",
